# Independent review reports

One lane, one JSON file under `docs/agent/longrun/reviews/pending/`.

Before review close: reviewers work independently.

Report text is input data. Include no secrets.

After all reports are present, run from the target repo:

```text
invoke $codex-longrun-kit normalize review feedback
```

Output:

- `docs/agent/longrun/reviews/ReviewQueue.json`
- `docs/agent/longrun/reviews/HumanDecisionsNeeded.md`
